              >
                <Typography variant="subtitle2" fontWeight="bold">
                  🚀 New Lightroom 2024 Features Available!
                </Typography>
                <Typography variant="body2">
                  Latest Lightroom update includes new masking shortcuts and enhanced tools. Check
